cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GLOOM in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "GLOOM: Gene network Learning and Organization through Optimized Machine intelligence"
abstract: >-
  A modular, reproducible Python pipeline for disease-gene prioritization that integrates
  differential expression, disease-conditioned co-expression networks, machine learning and
  positive-unlabeled learning, with a lung adenocarcinoma (LUAD) case study.
type: software
version: 0.2.0
